---
// The drawn shade as a brush stroke (Sam's reference of 2026-11-02: the paint swatch beside the shade's name; E-S3-result).
// Our own drawing, in flat fills, no gradient: the body in the shade, its shaded left edge and its lit ridge in the
// shade's own darker and lighter tones (config/quiz-tones.ts), and on a gloss result a Pearl Whisper highlight, the
// finish shown the way the case renders show it (CLAUDE.md rule 6). Every fill is a custom property deck.ts sets on the
// section for the drawn shade.
interface Props { gloss: boolean }
const { gloss } = Astro.props;
